# Frontend Environment Variables Template (Vercel / Local)
#
# When running locally:
# Leave empty to let Vite proxy forward /api to http://localhost:8080
#
# When deploying to Vercel:
# Set this to your Render backend URL, e.g.:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://nexus-comply-server.onrender.com/api/v1
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
